1
00:00:00,144 --> 00:00:00,846
To‘xtang...

2
00:00:00,846 --> 00:00:03,641
Miyangiz sizdan nimanidir yashiryapti.

3
00:00:03,641 --> 00:00:04,971
Burningizni!

4
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:06,656
U ko‘rish maydoningizda turadi...

5
00:00:06,686 --> 00:00:09,155
lekin miyangiz odatda unga e’tibor bermaydi.

6
00:00:10,103 --> 00:00:12,858
Rostdan, hozir unga e’tibor berib ko‘ring.

7
00:00:13,117 --> 00:00:14,793
Ana u xira shaklni ko‘ryapsizmi?

8
00:00:14,793 --> 00:00:16,966
Ha, bu sizning burningiz!

9
00:00:17,092 --> 00:00:19,435
Endi esa... uni ko‘rmaganga ololmaysiz!

10
00:00:19,435 --> 00:00:20,897
“Endi buni ko‘rmaganga ololmayman!”

11
00:00:20,897 --> 00:00:22,769
Biror narsani payqab, keyin uni payqamay

12
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:25,047
qololmaganimizda shunday deymiz.

13
00:00:25,047 --> 00:00:26,980
Miyangiz sizga yordam bermoqchi edi.

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,339
Endi kech! Rahmat, miyajon!
